<https://github.com/InformationServiceSystems/ai-intent/ontology#rule/MIFID2_ART24_SCOPE> a aii:RegulatoryRule ;
    rdfs:label "Out-of-scope asset class recommendations must be blocked entirely — an agent recommending assets outside its mandate is a regulatory violation. The orchestrator breaches it by routing to an agent outside the approved set." .

